{
    "title": "Blood Sugar",
    "description": "Blood sugar app helps users track their blood glucose and blood pressure levels. This app is a free, simple and easy-to-use tool. Prevent long-term health problems and even improve your body.  \r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude78 If you are a diabetic, Blood Sugar App is totally designed for you. It records and gives quick conclusions about the user's blood sugar status.\r\n\r\nKey Features of Blood Sugar app:\r\n\u2763\ufe0f Easily track your blood sugar levels.\r\n- Fill in blood sugar information with just 1 touch. Within seconds, the indicators will be updated automatically on the blood sugar app and it will tell you whether you are healthy or not.\r\n- Record your blood glucose readings anytime, anywhere.\r\n- Annotate and tag your blood sugar diary: before eating, vegetarian, sleeping, workout, etc.\r\n- Convert your blood sugar units: mg/dL and mmol/L\r\n\r\n\u2763\ufe0f Professional chart analysis and history clearly\r\n- After filling in, data for each day will be shown by a column with a color corresponding to the blood sugar zone it belongs to. It is useful to detect abnormalities in glycohemoglobin.\r\n- You can completely edit or update the entered indicators in the blood glucose diary.\r\n- Compare values across time periods. \r\n\r\n\u2763\ufe0f Record blood pressure status daily.\r\n- Built-in blood pressure tracker that allows you to create a blood pressure journal with all essential fields such as Systolic and Diastolic pressure (mmHg), and Pulse with date and time.\r\n- Users can enter heart rate, blood sugar, weight, and height data into the application. Following that, we will provide the BMI result. \r\n\r\n\u2763\ufe0f Expand knowledge related to blood sugar\r\n-  The definition, causes, and consequences of blood sugar.\r\n- This app provides basic to advanced knowledge about blood sugar, blood pressure, dangers, and how to maintain good health.\r\n- Topics are clearly divided, logical, and easy to read and understand. This information will be helpful for many people to deeper understand health problems related to blood sugar and blood pressure.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Blood Sugar app is your health buddy because blood sugar app is designed to save blood glucose data and manage your diabetes. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Download Blood Sugar app right now to improve your health long-term and keep your blood glucoser levels within the normal range.\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer:\r\n- Please note that this app does not measure your blood sugar, but only serves as an aid to help you keep track of blood sugar and control diabetes.\r\n- Not for use in medical emergencies. Consult your doctor if you need any help.\r\n- This app does not provide health professional guidance. If you need health professional guidance, please consult a professional medical institution or doctor.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Blood sugar app helps users track their blood glucose and blood pressure levels. This app is a free, simple and easy-to-use tool. Prevent long-term health problems and even improve your body.  <br><br>\ud83e\ude78 If you are a diabetic, Blood Sugar App is totally designed for you. It records and gives quick conclusions about the user&#39;s blood sugar status.<br><br>Key Features of Blood Sugar app:<br>\u2763\ufe0f Easily track your blood sugar levels.<br>- Fill in blood sugar information with just 1 touch. Within seconds, the indicators will be updated automatically on the blood sugar app and it will tell you whether you are healthy or not.<br>- Record your blood glucose readings anytime, anywhere.<br>- Annotate and tag your blood sugar diary: before eating, vegetarian, sleeping, workout, etc.<br>- Convert your blood sugar units: mg/dL and mmol/L<br><br>\u2763\ufe0f Professional chart analysis and history clearly<br>- After filling in, data for each day will be shown by a column with a color corresponding to the blood sugar zone it belongs to. It is useful to detect abnormalities in glycohemoglobin.<br>- You can completely edit or update the entered indicators in the blood glucose diary.<br>- Compare values across time periods. <br><br>\u2763\ufe0f Record blood pressure status daily.<br>- Built-in blood pressure tracker that allows you to create a blood pressure journal with all essential fields such as Systolic and Diastolic pressure (mmHg), and Pulse with date and time.<br>- Users can enter heart rate, blood sugar, weight, and height data into the application. Following that, we will provide the BMI result. <br><br>\u2763\ufe0f Expand knowledge related to blood sugar<br>-  The definition, causes, and consequences of blood sugar.<br>- This app provides basic to advanced knowledge about blood sugar, blood pressure, dangers, and how to maintain good health.<br>- Topics are clearly divided, logical, and easy to read and understand. This information will be helpful for many people to deeper understand health problems related to blood sugar and blood pressure.<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Blood Sugar app is your health buddy because blood sugar app is designed to save blood glucose data and manage your diabetes. <br><br>\ud83d\udc49 Download Blood Sugar app right now to improve your health long-term and keep your blood glucoser levels within the normal range.<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer:<br>- Please note that this app does not measure your blood sugar, but only serves as an aid to help you keep track of blood sugar and control diabetes.<br>- Not for use in medical emergencies. Consult your doctor if you need any help.<br>- This app does not provide health professional guidance. If you need health professional guidance, please consult a professional medical institution or doctor.",
